{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/hado-beyond-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1354,"crm_id":"196","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Hado","slug":"hado-beyond-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment","simplex","duplex"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Beyond","price":null,"display_price":"TBA","lattitude":25.0474505,"longitude":55.2074301,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Discover Hado by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-beyond/\">Beyond</a>, an exclusive waterfront community in Siora, Dubai Islands, designed for those who value refined living and timeless elegance.</p><p>Three sculpted towers rise above serene coastal landscapes, offering beautifully crafted 1<strong> to 3-bedroom residences</strong>, <strong>along with limited premium duplexes and simplex homes</strong>, all inspired by Japanese principles of balance, light, and simplicity.</p><p>Residents enjoy uninterrupted sea, cove, and skyline views, elevated interiors with natural materials, and a lifestyle enriched by resort-style amenities including an elegant arrival lobby, wellness spa, fitness studio, Chef’s Kitchen, cigar lounge, kids’ areas, and tranquil garden terraces.</p><p>Set within a master-planned district shaped for wellbeing and connection, Hado by Beyond at Dubai Islands presents a rare opportunity to invest in a destination where architecture, nature, and luxury living come together effortlessly.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_3d1bc44ffc.jpg","hash":"Feature_3d1bc44ffc","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_d047cd0f54.jpg","hash"