l}],"bitrix":{"id":1391,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Hado","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"BEYOND","project_location":null},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mobile_19046d8b5c.jpg","hash":"Mobile_19046d8b5c","name":"Mobile.jpg"},"seo":{"id":2166,"metaTitle":"Hado by Beyond at Dubai Islands - Apartments for Sale","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Explore Hado by Beyond, offering 1 to 4-bedroom homes in Siora - the latest residential district at the heart of Dubai Islands."},"more_info":[{"id":9134,"answer":"<p>Hado by Beyond is located in the heart of Siora, a premium district within Dubai Islands. The location offers direct access to pristine beaches, resort-style amenities, retail, wellness spaces, and exceptional connectivity to key destinations across Dubai.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Hado by Beyond located?"},{"id":9135,"answer":"<p>Hado by Beyond at Dubai Islands stands out for its sculptural architecture, calm coastal setting, panoramic 360-degree water views, and a masterplan that blends nature, wellness, and community living. It is designed as a sanctuary where stillness and movement coexist.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes Hado by Beyond at Dubai Islands unique?"},{"id":9136,"answer":"<p>Hado Amenities include a resort-style pool deck, zen lounge, Chef’s Kitchen, cigar lounge, wellness spa, yoga studio, fitness studio, kids’ club, outdoor play areas, terrace gardens, boutique retail, and a refined arrival experience with sculptural landscaping.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities does Hado offer?"},{"id":9137,"answer":"<p>The Hado Masterplan is part of the larger Siora district, featuring expansive beaches, interconnected jogging and cycling routes, curated green spaces, premium hospitality, and artistic landscape design inspired by Japanese gardens. The design ensures balance, openness, and exceptional water-facing views.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the Hado Masterplan?"},{"id":9138,"answer":"<p>Yes. Hado by Beyond offers waterfront living, exclusive amenities, a premium Dubai Islands address, and strong projected capital appreciation. Its limited supply of high-end residences makes it attractive for both end users and investors.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Hado by Beyond a good investment?"},{"id":9139,"answer":"<p>The project offers a structured plan, including 10% on booking, 10% in one month, several 5% installments during construction, and 50% on completion (anticipated Q3 2029).<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan?"},{"id":9140,"answer":"<p>Depending on the unit, residents can enjoy views of the ocean, cove, beach, skyline, and landscaped community spaces. Many homes feature corner glazing to maximize natural light and panoramic scenery.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What views do the units offer?"},{"id":9141,"answer":"<p>Hado is developed by Beyond, part of the premium Omniyat Group, known for delivering thoughtfully designed luxury projects across Dubai.</p>","question":"Who is the developer of Hado?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Sponsored_1fae95244a.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Sponsored_1fae95244a.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1300x500/Sponsored_1fae95244a.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1300x500","created_at":"2025-12-11 13:36:01.111","updated_at":"2025-12-11 13:36:01.111"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/600x/Sponsored_1fae95244a.webp","format":"webp","transform":"600x","created_at":"2025-12-11 13:36:04.172","updated_at":"2025-12-11 13:36:04.172"}]},{"src_url":"i/Mobile_9439a7b321.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Mobile_9439a7b321.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/420x/Mobile_9439a7b321.webp","format":"web